    - Implemented per-stage texel/ray outcome counters, useful progress, pending-page age and
      observed completion latency, GPU timestamp intervals, callback wall time and existing map
      costs. Eight-slot asynchronous collectors skip instrumentation under pressure, never work.
      SurfaceWorkDiagnosticsEnabled toggles GPU instrumentation without resetting lighting.
    - Matched controlled baseline passed 72 off/on ABBA legs across capture, direct and indirect,
      resolved and outside-coverage workloads, with identical initialized output texels. Counts,
      hardware, instrumentation overhead and interpretation limits:
      docs/LumOn.SurfaceCache.TracingBaseline.md. Current gameplay reason frequencies still require
